{"id":"4505fdbef0375a48","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-generated-submodel.md","title":"Generated Submodel","display":"df-generated-submodel — Generated Submodel","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-generated-submodel","aliases":["89-df-generated-submodel"],"display":"df-generated-submodel — Generated Submodel","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-generated-submodel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-generated-submodel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generated-submodel — Generated Submodel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\\)</span> (Kripke model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w \\in W\">\\(w \\in W\\)</span> (world, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generated\\text{-}submodel}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nR^{*}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{S\\subseteq W^2\\mid\n\\{\\langle u,u\\rangle\\mid u\\in W\\}\\cup R\\subseteq S\n\\land S\\circ S\\subseteq S\\},\\\\\nW_w&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v\\in W\\mid wR^{*}v\\},\\\\\nR_w&amp;\\coloneqq R\\cap(W_w\\times W_w),\\\\\nV_w(p)&amp;\\coloneqq V(p)\\cap W_w\n\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M}_w&amp;\\coloneqq(W_w,R_w,V_w).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generated\\text{-}submodel}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nR^{*}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{S\\subseteq W^2\\mid\n\\{\\langle u,u\\rangle\\mid u\\in W\\}\\cup R\\subseteq S\n\\land S\\circ S\\subseteq S\\},\\\\\nW_w&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v\\in W\\mid wR^{*}v\\},\\\\\nR_w&amp;\\coloneqq R\\cap(W_w\\times W_w),\\\\\nV_w(p)&amp;\\coloneqq V(p)\\cap W_w\n\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M}_w&amp;\\coloneqq(W_w,R_w,V_w).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_w\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_w\\)</span> : 由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>生成的子模型</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^*\">\\(R^*\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>的自反传递闭包</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_w\">\\(W_w\\)</span> : 从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>可达的所有世界</li>\n<li>生成子模型嵌入保持所有模态公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_w\">\\(W_w\\)</span> 中的局部真值；若原框架\n是 GL 框架，其生成子框架仍是 GL 框架。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M} =